Purpose: justify dropping Saturation Quadrants (redundant with
Incidence-Guided Saturation Quadrants) and Balanced Halves (redundant
with Balanced Quartiles) from the 6-design manuscript comparison.
Reported for queen (primary), rook, and a labeled POOLED slice.
